comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-14T08:59:15.952Z",codex-sweep-1114,"2026-11-14 sweep: inspected context, searched prior hygiene work, and read the complete tracker. Verify each in-progress item against acceptance, merged delivery, exact PR-head checks and linked issue state. Close complete delivery, reopen idle or partial work, preserve other live claims and all prior history."
  "2026-11-14T08:59:41.179Z",codex-sweep-1114,"Sweep decisions: 4 delivered items closed, 0 idle or partial items reopened, 0 canceled, 0 left alone. Evidence and remaining work are recorded per item. Linked git diff --check passed. Final tracker and changelog validation follows; release gates and hosted CI are separate evidence."
  "2026-11-14T10:14:01.069Z",codex-sweep-1114,"Release-attribution correction continuation: use each delivered item's evidenced PR merge timestamp for completed_at and its first containing release tag for release. Preserve genuinely unreleased items without a release value, all statuses and existing claims. Sweep chore completion/release and reopened work are excluded. Regenerate and verify changelog placement, append-only history and health after the last write."
  "2026-11-14T10:14:20.889Z",codex-sweep-1114,"Release metadata corrected for 4 delivered items: 0 attributed to first containing tags and 4 left genuinely unreleased. Linked diff check passed. Independent timestamp/tag/changelog-placement validation and regenerated changelog checks follow this final tracker write. No review thread replies, resolutions or reactions."
